<title>UK: UK notes in circulation rise 6.2 pct in week.</title>
<headline>UK notes in circulation rise 6.2 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>British bank notes in circulation rose 6.2 percent in the week to Feb 20 over the equivalent year-ago week, data released by the Bank of England showed. Last week the annual rise was 6.1 percent.</p>
<p>NOTES IN CIRCULATION (in rounded bln stg) -</p>
<p>				Latest week  pvs week	yr-ago week</p>
<p> Notes in circulation     20.58	  20.56	   19.40</p>
<p> Bankers' deposits	   1.93	   2.15	    1.84</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
</text>
